<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 60,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 60,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est 60,000, Wk ago 111,000, Yr ago 113,000. Saturday's 10,000, 16,000, and 40,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was very slow for good demand light offerings. Weather disrupting hog and product movement in Northwest area. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
